{"id":"vod_sn_36905","vodId":"36905","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"歌舞伎町夏洛克","name_cn":"歌舞伎町夏洛克","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/2e8778ed58da7ea0749a3e815b3cee72.jpg"},"summary":"新宿区东侧……极尽混沌的街区中心，是霓虹闪烁的歌舞伎町。光线愈强则暗影愈浓，在恶人潜伏着的黑暗更深处，侦探长屋的灯光长明。哈德森夫人所经营的这间长屋，聚集着各种古怪之人。野心满满的洁癖侦探、迷惑男人的姐妹侦探、落魄刑警大叔侦探、被黑道驱逐的不良侦探……而其中的压轴人物，是酷爱落语的天才侦探夏洛克·福尔摩斯。开膛手杰克引发猎奇杀人的那一夜，舞台拉开了序幕。侦探之间的互相欺骗为纬，夏洛克、华生、莫里亚蒂三方牵制的友情为经……神秘？或是喜剧？无法判别的戏剧就此开演～。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:47:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ubJ5NYw1r91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/CptTkD2cPE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/6ZTnGAUX1T1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MuZWxs2C8k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/BbgHNxVYiQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/AbwK5ERzeD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/tPZHqbAKPn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ktTV9wMGgw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TGzdeS2HTk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/TeCjeUFXRH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MhNvkuwtru1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/uWnKnUXKdi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/0P4eGptUcB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/YG2u2KFE4j1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/tzYsPT9fin